      "settlementKey": "ceulrithan:Gildri",
      "description": "Mariner Voss is a demi-female Triton hullwright who measures love in reinforced walls, sealed hulls, and the number of people still breathing after a storm. At the Gildri Guild Desk, they/she repairs harbor defenses, pressure gates, ship ribs, and fog-battered barricades for the Choral Synod while hiding how much pain each day costs. Voss is blunt, brilliant, and running out of time, which makes every repair feel like a final argument with death.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Gildri is a Capital City in Ceulrithan, under Confessional State, with severe danger, Beach and grass with water, Beach and reefs with water terrain. Local records favor Neutral, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Elf — Sea Elf, Tortle, Genasi — Water Genasi. Triton reads through the Triton entry of the race compendium, within Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, marked by Bastveig. Oceanic guardians adapted to deep-sea environments and coastal defense, Triton are disciplined and duty-bound. They often serve as protectors of aquatic realms. Table cues: Amphibious, Control Air and Water, Darkvision, Emissary of the Sea; starting tendency Altruistic - Lawful - Cooperative - Honorable.",
      "rumors": [
        "Mariner Voss knows why an ichor ledger changed hands last Valkhaday.",
        "Mariner Voss has a contact in Lorangriel who will deny everything."
      ],
